Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 696 "[Lemegeton] The Beginning of the Devil War"
    Journal for karus "You must help [Order of the Sorcery] Bros to prepare for sealing devil. "
    Journal for elmorad "You must help [Order of the Sorcery] Sais to prepare to seal the devil."

Requires player level >= 70

Rewards none

On available
    Say "Master! [Order of the Sorcery] is looking for you in Ronark Land. What do they want this time?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Greetings, <selfname>. I am Bros of [Order of the Sorcery]. I'm on some mission here in Ronark Land."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It's called the [Devil War]. Many members of [Order of the Sorcery] have fought and died in this war.\n\nTherefore I want to make a request to you. Can you participate in this [Devil War]? Help us seal [72 Devil] and drive devils away from this world.\n\nYou need to speak to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Land Ronark."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Greetings, <selfname>. I am Sais of [Order of the Sorcery]. I'm on some mission here in Ronark Land."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It's called the [Devil War]. Many members of [Order of the Sorcery] have fought and died in this war.\n\nTherefore I want to make a request to you. Can you participate in this [Devil War]? Help us seal [72 Devil] and drive devils away from this world.\n\nYou need to speak to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Land Ronark."

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you! First, we'll need a ring to seal the devils. I'm not able to leave my place now, so please collect the materials instead of me. First, receive [Ordinary old ring] from [Daughter of Grand Merchant] Menissiah of Moradon and [Magical power transmit marble] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond in Folk Village of Moradon and bring them to me."
